<title>UK: FirstBus preferred bidder for rail franchise.</title>
<headline>FirstBus preferred bidder for rail franchise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>FirstBus Plc has been chosen as the preferred bidder for the Great Eastern Railway passenger rail franchise -- one of 25 available under privatisation of the UK rail network.</p>
<p>The announcement was made by franchising director John O'Brien of the Office of Passenger Rail Franchising (Opraf). Further deails are expected soon.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
